 - 2026-06-07: Archive .362 -> activate .363; GREEN-GATE de-risk + RETIRE the facts graph-grounding route to honest future-work: exp3920 BLOCKED+FLAGGED a 4th consecutive time (exp3862 stub / exp3886 model-not-invoked / exp3896 separable-fixture / exp3920 blocked_llama_cpp), so add the graph-grounding fact-verifier scope to ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml (retire_if_same_verdict satisfied) and document facts as honest future-work (KGHaluBench-graded testbed for any future revival). Assert research-complete.yaml parses, the core pretest subset is green, and record the .362 below-chance-LLM-judge comparator flaw as the .363 forward-bet. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: archived_v362_v363_active_facts_retired_comparator_flaw_recorded_green_gates; results/experiment_3924_archive_v362_activate_v363_retire_facts.json
 - 2026-06-07: VALID EFFICIENCY head-to-head — energy-verifier vs the COMPETENT judge (north-star §5, finally testable; disk-reads exp3925+exp3905, no hard gate): on the exp3884 in-distribution corpus (n>=200), score with BOTH the energy ensemble (cheap CPU forward-pass) and the exp3925 competent GenRM/ThinkPRM judge (via the robust harness). POSITIVE CONTROL: assert the judge AUROC clears a defensible floor (>0.6) on THIS corpus BEFORE any verdict. Report accuracy parity/Pareto (energy within or above the judge CI) + a defensible cost ratio (wall-clock AND FLOP/token, amortized load excluded). Target: 'parity or dominance at Nx cheaper.' HONEST: if the competent judge BEATS energy on accuracy, say so — the cascade then becomes the deployable story. The 60s live-floor applies on THIS full-corpus artifact (NOT a fixture). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_upstream_competent_judge_not_ready; results/experiment_3926_valid_efficiency_head_to_head.json
 - 2026-06-07: NON-DEGENERATE Meta-EBM cascade router (positive-control escalation>0; disk-reads exp3926, no hard gate): the cheap energy verifier scores EVERY item; close-calls (energy margin within a tuned band) escalate to the COMPETENT judge (reuse exp3926 per-item judge scores — no re-inference). POSITIVE CONTROL: escalation_fraction MUST be > 0 (the .362 cascade was degenerate at escfrac=0.0). Tune the band on a calibration split, evaluate held-out; report cascade AUROC vs pure-competent-judge AUROC, escalation fraction, and cascade cost vs pure-judge. The deployable form of 'matched accuracy at Nx cheaper' (the Wastefulness Condition is checkable on calibration data alone). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_upstream_valid_efficiency_missing; results/experiment_3927_non_degenerate_cascade_router.json
+- 2026-06-07: MOAT SCISSOR replication on an INDEPENDENT corpus (defeats the in-distribution-tuning critique): re-run the exp3916 scissor (strong boosted self-verify arm via the exp3915 robust harness + bootstrap CI residual-catch + error-overlap Jaccard) on a SECOND held-out corpus — a ProcessBench math slice (HuggingFace Qwen/ProcessBench), FALLBACK the local held-out data/fover_test_v4.json — that neither the energy ensemble nor the FoVer-tuned probe was trained on. Confirm MOAT_SURVIVES (residual_catch_ci95.low>0.5 AND overlap<0.6 AND n_res>=30) replicates off the original corpus. Disk-reads exp3915 (no hard gate). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_all_gguf_inference_failed; results/experiment_3928_moat_scissor_replication.json
